>
  <MedicalNote />

  <div class="not-prose mb-8 grid gap-4 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft p-5 sm:p-6">
    <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">The Golden Rule of Protein Math</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-body mb-2">Every single gram of protein you eat contains exactly 4 calories. To calculate your numbers, use these two simple formulas:</p>
    <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="card p-4 text-center bg-canvas">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase text-mute tracking-wider">To Find Calories</p>
